00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Maya: The weather is changing faster than we expected.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Ravi: We should turn the boat toward the harbor.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Maya: Wait. The lighthouse signal is telling us there is another route.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Ravi: Then follow the signal, but keep the engine ready.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Maya: Agreed. We will reach the harbor before the storm arrives.
